The digest authentication code in this package originated in the vendored
WSMAN library that used to live at internal/wsman, a fork of
github.com/ammmze/wsman, and is distributed under the Apache License 2.0 in
LICENSE alongside this file.

The rest of this repository is MIT licensed; see the LICENSE at the repository
root. This directory keeps its own LICENSE because those terms differ.

digest.go additionally derives from:
  https://code.google.com/p/mlab-ns2/source/browse/gae/ns/digest/digest.go

The remainder of the former internal/wsman package -- its SOAP message
construction, enumeration and transport -- was removed when this library moved
to github.com/device-management-toolkit/go-wsman-messages. Only the digest
authentication code was retained, because go-wsman-messages' challenge parser
mis-reads the malformed WWW-Authenticate headers some Intel NUCs emit.
